{
  "_readme": "One entry per template. 'fields' lists every id the generation engine should treat as a data-binding target \u2014 i.e. text to replace or an image to inject. Purely decorative/structural ids (gradients, clip-paths, corner ornaments, wrapper groups, static design labels) are intentionally excluded; the SVGs contain many more ids than are listed here, and that's expected. type 'text' = replace element's text content. type 'image' = set the element's image href to the uploaded file, scaled to fit its bounding box. required=false fields may be left blank/skipped per FR-2.7 (optional fields render blank, template layout never shifts).",
